# === Mac client bridge build output (crates/quilin-bridge/out/) ===
# UniFFI/Swift binding output (.dylib, .a, .h, .modulemap, .swift) is
# generated by `crates/quilin-bridge/build-mac.sh` and consumed by the
# Mac client repo `~/repo/quilin-agent-mac-app`. Build artifact, never
# committed.
crates/quilin-bridge/out/

